Some features from Search API are not yet available in KB Retrieval API, meaning KB is unable to perform the same as chat similarity's Search and result in lower quality output. 
 
This is why we would need to modify the harness with custom function to fill in those gaps until KB Retrieval releases the feature we need.
 
Essentially, Retrieval performance will eventually be on par with the existing chat similarity Search. 
However, there are 2 main concerns: 
Some features are still not available on KB such as facet (grouping), count, etc... which are the cores that allows a higher project recall - the ability to find all all relevant projects when user asks a broad question (i.e, which project worked with vendor: Kinaxis), without facet (grouping), one project with greater data might take up more space and leave out relevant projects. 
